@* About：アプリのアイコン・名前・バージョン・開発元・お問い合わせ先と、使用許諾契約・第三者ソフトウェアのライセンス *@
@using ReachForge.Infrastructure.Help
@inject IDialogService Dialogs

<MudDialog>
    <TitleContent>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">@AppInfo.Name について</MudText>
    </TitleContent>
    <DialogContent>
        <div class="d-flex align-center gap-4">
            <img src="icon.png" alt="" width="72" height="72" style="border-radius:16px" />
            <div>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.h5"><b>@AppInfo.Name</b></MudText>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Style="color:var(--rf-color-text-secondary)">@AppInfo.Subtitle</MudText>
            </div>
        </div>
        <table class="rf-summary mt-4" aria-label="アプリケーションの情報">
            <tbody>
                <tr><th scope="row">バージョン</th><td>@AppInfo.DisplayVersion</td></tr>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="row">開発元</th>
                    <td><MudLink Href="@AppInfo.DeveloperUrl" Target="_blank" rel="noopener">@AppInfo.Developer</MudLink></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="row">お問い合わせ先</th>
                    <td><MudLink Href="@($"mailto:{AppInfo.ContactEmail}")">@AppInfo.ContactEmail</MudLink></td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4">
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Rounded.Gavel" OnClick="() => ShowLegalAsync(RfLegalDialog.Eula)">使用許諾契約</MudButton>
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Rounded.Description" OnClick="() => ShowLegalAsync(RfLegalDialog.ThirdParty)">第三者ソフトウェアのライセンス</MudButton>
        </div>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Class="d-block mt-4" Style="color:var(--rf-color-text-tertiary)">@AppInfo.Copyright</MudText>
    </DialogContent>
    <DialogActions>
        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" OnClick="() => Dialog.Close()">閉じる</MudButton>
    </DialogActions>
</MudDialog>

@code {
    [CascadingParameter] private IMudDialogInstance Dialog { get; set; } = default!;

    private Task ShowLegalAsync(string kind) =>
        Dialogs.ShowAsync<RfLegalDialog>(kind == RfLegalDialog.Eula ? "使用許諾契約" : "第三者ソフトウェアのライセンス",
            new DialogParameters<RfLegalDialog> { { x => x.Kind, kind } },
            new DialogOptions { MaxWidth = MaxWidth.Medium, FullWidth = true, CloseButton = true, CloseOnEscapeKey = true });
}
